{"qid": "c05", "family": "c", "split": "dev", "method": "M3", "model": "luna", "answer": {"method": "M3", "model": "luna", "final": {"answer": "For FV-2-2, the listed valve-plug seal options include carbon-filled PTFE (−73 to 232 °C / −100 to 450 °F), PTFE with an N10276 spring (−73 to 232 °C / −100 to 450 °F), and PTFE/graphite with an R30003 spring (−73 to 316 °C / −100 to 600 °F). Backup-ring materials include fluorocarbon (−18 to 204 °C / 0 to 400 °F), ethylene-propylene (−40 to 232 °C / −40 to 450 °F), and nitrile (−40 to 71 °C / −40 to 160 °F for air and hydrocarbons; −40 to 82 °C / −40 to 180 °F for other compatible fluids). With PEEK anti-extrusion rings, the extended assembly limit is 316 °C / 600 °F for non-oxidizing service or 260 °C / 500 °F for oxidizing service.", "not_present": false}, "outcome": "ANSWERED", "route": ["context_rag+chunks"], "cypher": [], "sources": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "pages": [22, 12, 4, 20, 5, 2, 14, 21, 11, 7]}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "pages": [7]}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "pages": [68]}], "latency_s": 11.71849379997002, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 17036, "completion_tokens": 1244, "cost_usd": 0.0027475150000000003, "spent_usd": 0.002747175, "n_calls": 2, "n_cached": 1, "models": ["openai/gpt-6-luna", "qwen/qwen3-embedding-8b"]}, "trace": {"chunks": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 22, "score": 0.7017}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 12, "score": 0.6793}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 4, "score": 0.6732}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 20, "score": 0.6718}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 5, "score": 0.6639}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "page": 7, "score": 0.663}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 2, "score": 0.6623}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 14, "score": 0.6556}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 21, "